            "review_title": "Review at O'sen Deli",
            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12939 contributions\n20\nDelicious and Very Good Value Vietnamese Breakfast for Two in Grand Park\nJan 2025 • Friends\nI came here with a friend on January 1 for Brunch. There have both indoor and covered outdoor areas. We took a seat outside and ordered: two servings of the traditional Cơm tấm sườn bì chả ốp la. This is Broken rice with pork chop, pork skin & fried egg. It is served with pickled vegetables as well. Perfect meal to start a day.\n\nThe food was delicious and filling, also super affordable (local prices). If the service was a little bit more attentive, having to ask again for a drink left off the order, I would have given 5 stars. I guess realistically to be fair to them, for the morning after New Year’s Eve, they were doing very well just to be open and getting food out to everyone, well done. I will eat here again.\nRead more\nWritten January 3, 2025",
